	<section_number>46.2-1573.3</section_number>
	<catch_line>Exemption of franchises from Retail Franchising Act</catch_line>
	<text>
		Franchises subject to the provisions of this chapter shall not be subject to any requirement contained in Chapter 8 (§ 13.1-557 et seq.) of Title 13.1.
	</text>
	<history>1995, cc. 767, 816, § 46.2-1974; 2015, c. 615.</history>
